              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hes 35:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kuwa hatuna budi kufa, nasi tu kama maji yaliyomwagika chini, yasiyowezekana kuzoleka tena; wala Mungu haondoi maisha ila hufikiri shauri, kwamba yeye aliyefukuzwa asiwe mkimbizi kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata sasa nilivyokuja mimi kunena neno hili na bwana wangu mfalme, ni kwa sababu watu wamenitisha; nami, mjakazi wako, nikasema, Mimi nitanena sasa kwa mfalme; labda itakuwa mfalme atanifanyia haja yangu mimi mtumwa wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kuwa mfalme atasikia, ili amwokoe mtumwa wake mkononi mwa yule mtu atakaye kuniharibu mimi na mwanangu pia katika urithi wa Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:17"
          },
