        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo mimi mjakazi wako nikasema, Neno la bwana wangu mfalme na liwe la kustarehesha; kwa kuwa kama malaika wa Mungu ndivyo alivyo bwana wangu mfalme, kuyapambanua yaliyo mema na yaliyo mabaya; naye BWANA, Mungu wako na awe pamoja nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo mfalme akajibu, akamwambia yule mwanamke, usinifiche, nakusihi, neno lo lote nitakalokuuliza. Na mwanamke akasema, Na anene sasa bwana wangu mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme akasema, Je! Si mkono wa Yoabu ulio pamoja nawe katika haya yote? Mwanamke akajibu, akasema, Kama iishivyo roho yako, bwana wangu, mfalme, hapana mtu awezaye kugeuka kwa kuume, au kwa kushoto, kukana neno lo lote alilolisema bwana wangu mfalme; kwani mtumwa wako Yoabu ndiye aliyeniamuru, na kuyaweka maneno haya yote kinywani mwa mjakazi wako; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
