                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo akawaambia watumishi wake, Tazameni, shamba la Yoabu liko karibu na shamba langu, naye ana shayiri huko; nendeni mkalitie moto. Basi watumishi wa Absalomu wakalitia moto lile shamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
