                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Absalomu akamjibu Yoabu, Angalia, nilituma kwako, kusema, Njoo kwangu, ili nikupeleke kwa mfalme kunena, Mbona nimekuja kutoka Geshuri? Ingekuwa heri kwangu kama ningekuwako huko hata sasa; basi sasa na nimtazame uso mfalme; na ukiwapo uovu kwangu, na aniue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.32"
            ]
          }
