                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Yoabu akamwendea mfalme, akamwambia hayo, naye alipomwita Absalomu, yeye akaja kwa mfalme, akainama kifulifuli hata nchi mbele ya mfalme; naye mfalme akambusu Absalomu.",
